<title>SRI LANKA: Colombo port container traffic up 29 pct in '96.</title>
<headline>Colombo port container traffic up 29 pct in '96.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Colombo port, south Asia's transshipment hub, handled a record 1,356,302 containers in 1996, up 29 percent from the year before, Sri Lanka's Ports and Shipping Ministry said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
